{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2020-03-09 20:30:00', 'title': "IBM SAYS CEO VIRGINIA ROMETTY'S FY2019 TOTAL COMPENSATION WAS $20.2 MILLION", 'text': "IBM SAYS CEO VIRGINIA ROMETTY'S FY 2019 TOTAL COMPENSATION WAS $20.2 MILLION VERSUS $17.6 MILLION IN FY 2018 - SEC FILING.IBM SAYS CFO JAMES KAVANAUGH'S FY 2019 TOTAL COMPENSATION WAS $7.1 MILLION VERSUS $5.9 MILLION IN FY 2018.IBM SAYS  SENIOR VP, IBM GLOBAL MARKETS, MARTIN SCHROETER'S FY 2019 TOTAL COMPENSATION WAS $10.2 MILLION VERSUS $7.0 MILLION IN FY 2018.IBM SAYS FOR 2019, RATIO OF CEO’S ANNUAL TOTAL COMPENSATION TO THAT OF THE MEDIAN EMPLOYEE’S ANNUAL TOTAL COMPENSATION IS 354:1."}